          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_third_because_kernel_constant_dynami",
          "text": "Third, because the kernel is constant, the training dynamics collapse to a linear first-order differential equation whose infinite-time solution is a plain kernel regressor.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
            "because",
            "kernel",
            "constant",
            "dynamics",
