          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_fourth_validates_all_empirically_sol",
          "text": "And fourth, it validates all of this empirically and uses the solution to study when accuracy and robustness go together.",
