    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "method",
      "heading": "Method",
      "chunks": [
        {
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_how_works_robust_minimises_usual",
          "text": "Here is how it works. Robust training minimises the usual mean-squared error plus lambda times a penalty on the network's Jacobian at each training point.",
