        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_crucial_step_showing_kernel_does",
          "text": "The crucial step is showing this kernel does not move during training; that turns the learning dynamics into a linear differential equation, and its infinite-time solution is a kernel regression using the limiting JNTK, rescaled by a simple diagonal matrix that carries the regularisation strength lambda.",
