          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_network_gets_wider_finite_jacobian",
          "text": "As the network gets wider, the finite Jacobian NNGP kernel closes in on its predicted deterministic limit, and the scaled finite JNTK converges to the limiting JNTK, matching the two initialisation theorems.",
